   - "put" -> packet
   - "coil" -> coil (for wire)
   - "6M" on tape -> 6 metre
   - "4way", "3way", "1way" -> keep in product name (gang box 4way)
   - "6A", "32AMP", "2.5", "1.5", ".75 Sqr M.M" -> keep specs in name
