   ".75 Sqr M.M - 1 coil 1456/-" -> "havells wire 0.75 sq mm 1 coil 1456"

5. REMOVE completely: grand totals (₹ 22,008/-), dates (20/6/26), standalone amount columns, shop headers with only numbers (98000, 74536), empty lines, lone "PVC -"

